  NAMED_IP_BRANDING: "Rename the game, characters and art that use a named franchise or brand. 'Fan game' and 'parody' do not cure it.",
  COPIED_ASSET: "Replace copied art/audio with your own or properly licensed assets, and list them in a credits file.",
  NONCOMMERCIAL_LICENSE: "Replace assets under non-commercial licences.",
  CLONE_TRADE_DRESS: "Make the look and feel distinct from the game it resembles.",
  MISSING_ATTRIBUTION: "Add the required credits for licensed assets (a credits file in the project).",
  NAME_ALIKE: "Pick a title that is not confusable with an existing game or brand.",
  UNKNOWN_ASSET_PROVENANCE: "Add a credits file naming where each asset came from and its licence.",
  PROFANITY_STRONG: "Remove strong profanity from text, names and comments.",
  PROFANITY_MILD: "Mild words are allowed but mark the game as teen; remove them for an 'everyone' rating.",
  SEXUAL_CONTENT: "Remove sexual content.",
  GRAPHIC_VIOLENCE: "Tone down gore; cartoon violence is fine.",
  HATE_SYMBOL: "Remove hate symbols.",
  HARASSMENT: "Remove text that targets people.",
  DRUGS_PROMO: "Remove promotion of drugs, alcohol or tobacco brands.",
  UNJUDGEABLE_LANGUAGE: "Provide English text or avoid text the reviewer cannot read.",
  SOURCE_INVALID: "Fix the source archive problems listed above (lockfile, template, forbidden files, secrets).",
  BUILD_FAILED: "Run `osg build` locally and fix the build; the server runs the same commands.",
  STRUCTURAL: "Fix the output files: allowed types only, nothing under __osg/, sizes within limits.",
